From jmacdon at med.umich.edu  Wed Jan 30 16:31:17 2008
From: jmacdon at med.umich.edu (James W. MacDonald)
Date: Wed, 30 Jan 2008 10:31:17 -0500
Subject: [BioC] SAM siggenes number of permutations
In-Reply-To: <01b501c86350$42e9a100$3d63348d@ka.fzk.de>
